        "en-US": {
          "description": "A small Android keyboard for English and Arabic. It has no internet permission, so nothing you type can leave the phone.\n\n- Glide typing in both languages, offline\n- Word suggestions, next-word prediction and careful autocorrect that learn on the phone only\n- Hold space and drag to move the cursor; slide on delete to remove whole words\n- One-handed mode\n- Clipboard history with pins\n- Emoji panel with search by English or Arabic name\n- Classic tall keys, or Material You colours\n- Password fields: no learning, no history, hidden from screenshots\n",
          "featureGraphic": "featureGraphic_4xu9jhMFUDT1NmBzaZK5KIuTHGUs5FphDak886uBxJY=.png",
